  "measurement": {
    "band": "one percent unless a row declares its own. mork-native-add-8000 declares four: its minimum moved 1.605% across four runs and its samples spread 1.992% within one, where every other row moved under 0.240%. Adding 8000 clauses to a dynamic predicate grows SWI's clause store and its just-in-time index across resize thresholds, and where those land depends on allocation rather than on the workload.",
    "loadavg_while_pinning": "7.5 to 12.3 on a 32 core box",
    "taken": "2026-08-28",
    "wants_a_quiet_box": [
      "mork-native-add-8000, whose band is set from movement measured under load",
      "mork-native-match-last-8000, one sample of which came back 3.4x the other two in one run; the minimum of three absorbed it and the pin did not move"
    ]
  },
